# wear/woman/culturetunic_sleeve_l: the culture tunic's long sleeve over her left forearm: cloth1 to the wrist with
# an accent cuff band, the arm library's own shading kept (the hand left bare)
# One view per key of the woman's arm library (arms/adult/loco and arms/adult/pose woman_r / woman_l), on the same origin:
# a new arm key needs its view here too (the arm's forearm pixels recoloured in the sleeve's ramp, the hand left bare).
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# WOMAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): re-fitted to the i3 pump: the near pB sleeve on the redrawn forearm (3 rows: cloth,
# cloth, cuff), and the far arm's pump keys (pB pM pF pK) sleeved too (the far forearm a value darker, the hand bare).
use person woman
body woman
role garment culturetunic
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L
z 1

